# Flying witch: hovers on a broom, casts. She does not walk.
# GandalfHardcore enemy pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable
# on its own). 64x64 cells. Row 0 idle, then the action rows. The world
# view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips to face the heading.

sheet flyingwitch.ppm
cell 64 64

bank FLYINGWITCH
seq IDLE   loop ticks=4 : row 0 cols 0-4
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : row 1 cols 0-7
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : row 2 cols 0-6
